+      - B\ :sub:`03`
+      - FG\ :sub:`04`
+      - G\ :sub:`05`
+    * - G\ :sub:`10`
+      - R\ :sub:`11`
+      - FG\ :sub:`12`
+      - G\ :sub:`13`
+      - R\ :sub:`14`
+      - FG\ :sub:`15`
