@@ -0,0 +1,282 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2018 MediaTek Inc.
+ * Author: Holmes Chiou <holmes.chiou@mediatek.com>
+ *         Ping-Hsun Wu <ping-hsun.wu@mediatek.com>
+ *
